# Fork release notes

When preparing or publishing a fork release (`vX.Y.Z` on `feature/ops_ai_enhancements`):

1. Bump `package.json` `version`.
2. Add `CHANGELOG.md` `[X.Y.Z]` at the top (Chinese).
3. Write `RELEASE_NOTES_vX.Y.Z.draft.md` (English; this is the GitHub Release body).
4. Replace `README.zh-CN.md` **本版更新** with this version's highlights.
5. Fold lasting capabilities into `README.zh-CN.md` **本 fork 增强功能**, and sync the one-liner in `README.md`.

Do not tag or run `npm run release:win-x64` until those files match the same version. Full history stays in `CHANGELOG.md`; README **本版更新** is current-version only.
